opts←connectionArrowOptions con;r;vals
⍝ Fetch Arrow options from connection handle
⍝ con: duckdb_connection pointer
⍝ opts: duckdb_arrow_options pointer (destroy with destroyArrowOptions)

r←api.duckdb_connection_get_arrow_options con 0
vals←,r
opts←⊃vals
:If 1<≢vals
    ⍝ Some ⎕NA call patterns return duplicated handle tuples for void+out signatures.
    ⍝ If values differ, prefer the trailing out-argument slot.
    :If ~∧/vals=opts
        opts←¯1↑vals
    :EndIf
:EndIf
